  ✓ Check program fidelity and run independent differential tests
  ✓ Rebuild semantics/spec from clean scratch and rerun positive claims
  ✓ Audit claim adequacy, program pinning, and every local K rule
  ✓ Run fresh meaningful false mutation for non-vacuity
  ✓ Account for assumptions/trust boundaries and write REVIEW.md verdict
